OL,3,GNEWSABusiness owners' anger after shop 
OL,4,Awindows smashed                        
OL,6,FBusiness owners said they feel         
OL,7,F"shocked", "terrified" and "gutted"    
OL,8,Fafter their shop windows were smashed  
OL,9,Fin Hull city centre.                   
OL,11,FOwner of hair salon Blunt the Space,   
OL,12,FMegan Spitter, shared on social media  
OL,13,Fthe moment a youth on a bike kicked and
OL,14,Fshattered her window in Paragon Arcade 
OL,15,Fon Monday evening.                     
OL,17,FIn the Old Town, owner of pet shop Lili
OL,18,Fand Mila, Lisa Hall, shared a photo of 
OL,19,Fher front window after it was smashed  
OL,20,Fon 15 November.                        
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
