OL,3,GNEWSABusiness owners' anger after shop 
OL,4,Awindows smashed                        
OL,6,FSpitter, who has owned the salon for   
OL,7,Ftwo-and-a-half years, said she "had a  
OL,8,Fpanic attack" and "was sobbing" when   
OL,9,Fshe found out what had happened.       
